{"type":"record","name":"StrikeInvasionWallMeta","namespace":"com.optionsedge.contracts.strikeinvasion","doc":"The shadow-wall cache bookkeeping: the monotonic frame generation and the newest accepted frame time. Held only in the service's in-memory, non-logged wall store. Internal evidence record of strike-invasion-service: it crosses a Kafka repartition topic (and, per strike, a state-store changelog) declared by that service, never a public contract.","fields":[{"name":"generation","type":"long","doc":"Monotonic counter, deliberately not the frame time: two frames can share a bucketStartMs."},{"name":"watermark","type":"long","doc":"The newest accepted frame time; it only orders frames."}]}